pcsisr813 +

pcsisr814 +

pcsisr815

fatigue =~ pcsisr816 +

pcsisr817'

I would like to use the following cfa-function:

fit.pcsi8.fix <- cfa(eight.model,

                     data = pcsi8,

                     ordered = items.pcsi8)

